      "description": "Side-by-side visualization comparing self-loops at perfect vs imperfect consonances, illustrating the 12:1 bottleneck ratio.",
      "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset='utf-8'><title>Bottleneck</title><style>*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}body{font-family:'Segoe UI',system-ui,sans-serif;background:#0a0a1a;color:#e0e0e0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;padding:20px}h1{color:#8af;margin-bottom:4px}h2{color:#888;font-weight:normal;font-size:1em;margin-bottom:20px}.container{display:flex;gap:40px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center}.panel{background:#111;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;width:320px}.panel h3{text-align:center;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:1.1em}.bar-row{display:flex;align-items:center;margin:8px 0;gap:8px}.bar-label{width:80px;text-align:right;font-size:0.85em;color:#aaa}.bar-track{flex:1;height:24px;background:#1a1a2e;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden;position:relative}.bar-fill{height:100%;border-radius:4px;transition:width 0.8s ease}.bar-val{position:absolute;right:8px;top:3px;font-size:0.8em;font-weight:bold;color:#fff}.summary{text-align:center;margin-top:16px;padding-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #333;font-size:0.9em}.big-num{font-size:2.5em;font-weight:bold;display:block;margin:8px 0}.vs{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:20px;margin:20px 0;flex-wrap:wrap}.vs-box{text-align:center;background:#1a1a2e;border-radius:12px;padding:20px 30px}.vs-box .label{font-size:0.85em;color:#888;margin-bottom:4px}</style></head><body><h1>The Bottleneck Effect</h1><h2>Self-loops at perfect vs imperfect consonances</h2><div class='container'><div class='panel' style='border:2px solid #ff6b6b44'><h3 style='color:#ff6b6b'>Perfect Consonances</h3><div class='bar-row'><span class='bar-label'>Unison (0)</span><div class='bar-track'><div class='bar-fill' style='width:8.3%;background:#ff6b6b'></div><span class='bar-val'>1</span></div></div><div class='bar-row'><span class='bar-label'>P5th (7)</span><div class='bar-track'><div class='bar-fill' style='width:8.3%;background:#ff6b6b'></div><span class='bar-val'>1</span></div></div><div class='summary'>Only the identity (0,0) survives.<br>All 11 parallel motions are <b>forbidden</b>.<span class='big-num' style='color:#ff6b6b'>1</span>self-loop each</div></div><div class='panel' style='border:2px solid #4ecdc444'><h3 style='color:#4ecdc4'>Imperfect Consonances</h3><div class='bar-row'><span class='bar-label'>m3rd (3)</span><div class='bar-track'><div class='bar-fill' style='width:100%;background:#4ecdc4'></div><span class='bar-val'>12</span></div></div><div class='bar-row'><span class='bar-label'>M3rd (4)</span><div class='bar-track'><div class='bar-fill' style='width:100%;background:#4ecdc4'></div><span class='bar-val'>12</span></div></div><div class='bar-row'><span class='bar-label'>m6th (8)</span><div class='bar-track'><div class='bar-fill' style='width:100%;background:#4ecdc4'></div><span class='bar-val'>12</span></div></div><div class='bar-row'><span class='bar-label'>M6th (9)</span><div class='bar-track'><div class='bar-fill' style='width:100%;background:#4ecdc4'></div><span class='bar-val'>12</span></div></div><div class='summary'>All parallel motions (d,d) are allowed.<br>No restriction on imperfect targets.<span class='big-num' style='color:#4ecdc4'>12</span>self-loops each</div></div></div><div class='vs'><div class='vs-box'><div class='label'>Total incoming to perfect</div><span class='big-num' style='color:#ff6b6b;font-size:2em'>61</span></div><div style='font-size:2em;color:#555'>vs</div><div class='vs-box'><div class='label'>Total incoming to imperfect</div><span class='big-num' style='color:#4ecdc4;font-size:2em'>72</span></div><div class='vs-box' style='background:#1a1a0e'><div class='label'>Deficit</div><span class='big-num' style='color:#ffd93d;font-size:2em'>11</span><div style='font-size:0.85em;color:#888'>= non-trivial parallel motions blocked</div></div></div></body></html>"
